Backport llama.cpp OpenCL Flash Attention for Gemma 4 / Sigma.

Source: llama-cpp-python 0.3.32 (pinned wheelhouse sdist).
Upstream MIT-licensed changes:
  https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/commit/6f8895feec96773574c7e10fcf7b56965d23550a
  https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/commit/f2cc7282ce0042641df55e0e563b75e824e2b647
The f32/f16 kernel is taken verbatim from the second commit, including
intervening kernel correctness fixes. C++ context adapted to this version;
unrelated backend changes are excluded. DK512 decode and prefill compile
separately to avoid the Adreno compiler memory limit.

